{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださり、ありがとうございます☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 四期生\n埼玉県出身21歳の浅井恋乃未（あさいこのみ）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リアルミート&グリート、リアルサイン会"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2日間ありがとうございました☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobx1NbIW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobD0sAVG.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この靴、First Showcaseの私服ファッションショーで履いたやつなんだ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気が付いていたら、すごいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobtdqJAp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミーグリで初めてリボンつけた୨୧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小学生の頃はリボン大好きで、ずーっと頭にリボンつけてました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またつけよ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobVUMRnc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobYwC9R8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみにこのジャケットはお披露目のときのVlogで来てたやつ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気がついた？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おしゃれをしてきてくれて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何話そうかなーって考えてきてくれて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん想いを伝えてくれて、"}, {"t